# asm

Mommy! I think I know how to make shellcode

## Remote

Direct connection: `nc pwnable.kr 10015`

once you connect to port 10015, the "asm" binary will be executed under asm_pwn privilege.
make connection to challenge (nc pwnable.kr 10015) then get the flag. (file name of the flag is same as the one in this directory)

## Local run

Run `./run.sh`, then connect with `nc 127.0.0.1 10015`.
